[1;36mUsage:[0m tushare-downloader refresh 
           [OPTIONS] API

  Reconcile a range or snapshot with the
  source.

  Request when the last reconciliation
  is older than [1;32m--max-age[0m. Missing or
  invalid records are always requested.
  Use 0 to force. Calendar filtering
  still applies unless [1;32m--ignore-calendar[0m
  is given. Empty responses use
  EMPTY_RECHECK_AGE unless [1;32m--max-age[0m is
  0. Time-range APIs require both dates;
  snapshots reject dates.

[1;36mOptions:[0m
  [1;32m-s[0m, [1;32m--start[0m [%Y-%m-%d]  Inclusive date
                          (YYYY-MM-DD).
  [1;32m-e[0m, [1;32m--end[0m [%Y-%m-%d]    Inclusive date
                          (YYYY-MM-DD).
  [1;32m--dry-run[0m               Preview the
                          plan without
                          remote
                          requests or
                          data writes.
  [1;32m--ignore-calendar[0m       Bypass
                          trading-day
                          filtering for
                          this
                          invocation.
  [1;32m--max-age[0m TEXT          Freshness
                          threshold,
                          e.g. 12h, 7d,
                          or 0. Config:
                          MAX_AGE;
                          default: 24h.
  [1;32m-h[0m, [1;32m--help[0m              Show this
                          message and
                          exit.

[1;36mExamples:[0m
  tushare-downloader refresh \
    daily_basic [1;32m-s[0m 2026-09-01 [1;32m-e[0m \
    2026-09-10 [1;32m--max-age[0m 7d

  tushare-downloader [1;32m--plain[0m refresh \
    stock_basic [1;32m--max-age[0m 0

